      "created_at": "2014-10-21T18:58:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The biggest thing in the example given was that Wraith was not going to take the damage. &nbsp;You do not redirect damage that will not deal damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The reason we don't have a clearly spelled out order of timing for damage is that there are so many effects in the game that can complicate it that the fringe cases would take a huge amount of work to cover.</p>",
