      "created_at": "2014-11-12T07:44:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No, you don't. As they're not start of turn/end of turn effects, the players choose the order, and would likely choose CQC first so they get both damage bosts. That's certainly how it works in the video game.</p>",
